{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yongcheon High School, Turned into a Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the prestigious Yongcheon High School, an old ghost story has been whispered for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say that at midnight on a full moon, <strong>the cries of schoolgirls echo from the sealed occult club room in the basement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.poster.avif?t=1756198472\" width=780 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.webm?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.mp4?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity, four students performed a forbidden ritual and awakened the sealed spirits, plunging the school into a labyrinth of ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must fight through this endless midnight self-study, facing the spirits that haunt the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans That Pierce Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls have inherited shamanic power, allowing them to wield talismans. Fire projectiles that ricochet off walls and objects to strike talismans in a unique combat system, and banish the spirits that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.poster.avif?t=1756198472\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.webm?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.mp4?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans &amp; Relics: Endless Deckbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cleared battle rewards you with forbidden talismans. Combine talismans and mysterious relics to forge a cursed deck. With the school changing every run, your choices will decide whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.poster.avif?t=1756198472\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.webm?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.mp4?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Distinct Students</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haneul (Archery Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sumi (Kendo Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arin (Chemistry Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirae (Track &amp; Field)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character wields a unique weapon and fighting style, offering different tactical approaches to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.poster.avif?t=1756198472\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.webm?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.mp4?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folklore and School Ghost Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are more than simple spirits. Ghosts from <strong>Korean school ghost stories</strong> and traditional folklore manifest into reality. In dark classrooms, endless corridors, and sealed chambers, you will face beings once thought to exist only in legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.poster.avif?t=1756198472\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.webm?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.mp4?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three main chapters to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 talismans and relics to build your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique characters with distinct weapon styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A labyrinthine school structure that changes every run, with spirits that grow stronger over time</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879230?t=1756198472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879230?t=1756198472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/09f9b0fc2f579416ccc5ad222766b6412beda832/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756198472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/09f9b0fc2f579416ccc5ad222766b6412beda832/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756198472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Yongcheon High School, Turned into a Labyrinth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the prestigious Yongcheon High School, an old ghost story has been whispered for decades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say that at midnight on a full moon, <strong>the cries of schoolgirls echo from the sealed occult club room in the basement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.poster.avif?t=1756198472\" width=780 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.webm?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/3c8e4de093308ac40a1c7518e2bd7d88.mp4?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity, four students performed a forbidden ritual and awakened the sealed spirits, plunging the school into a labyrinth of ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you must fight through this endless midnight self-study, facing the spirits that haunt the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans That Pierce Spirits</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girls have inherited shamanic power, allowing them to wield talismans. Fire projectiles that ricochet off walls and objects to strike talismans in a unique combat system, and banish the spirits that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.poster.avif?t=1756198472\" width=780 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.webm?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/37fd12d9858fb638025efe8f9fc20183.mp4?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talismans &amp; Relics: Endless Deckbuilding</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each cleared battle rewards you with forbidden talismans. Combine talismans and mysterious relics to forge a cursed deck. With the school changing every run, your choices will decide whether you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.poster.avif?t=1756198472\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.webm?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/60ba070219185e0f52245e46ac427053.mp4?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Distinct Students</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haneul (Archery Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sumi (Kendo Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arin (Chemistry Club)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mirae (Track &amp; Field)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character wields a unique weapon and fighting style, offering different tactical approaches to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.poster.avif?t=1756198472\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.webm?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/ab6559b5fb6a6add6602976dd4cb074d.mp4?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Folklore and School Ghost Stories</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are more than simple spirits. Ghosts from <strong>Korean school ghost stories</strong> and traditional folklore manifest into reality. In dark classrooms, endless corridors, and sealed chambers, you will face beings once thought to exist only in legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.poster.avif?t=1756198472\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.webm?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/extras/441d7662842eeae5f8d51f709fa19aa3.mp4?t=1756198472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Access</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three main chapters to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 talismans and relics to build your deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four unique characters with distinct weapon styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A labyrinthine school structure that changes every run, with spirits that grow stronger over time</p></li></ul>","developers":["Geniesoft Inc."],"fullgame":{"appid":"3823430","name":"Midnight Study"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879230/c689fe2ca873d72a980cb3a772a3d9d259da0e29/header.jpg?t=1756198472","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Midnight Study Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Geniesoft Inc."],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"kgrb":{"rating":"12"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"22 Aug, 2025"},"required_age":0,"short_description":"Midnight Study is a roguelike deck-building horror game where four high school girls fight to reclaim a school overrun by vengeful spirits. Play as Kim Haneul, an archery ace descended from shamans, and battle ghosts from Korean school ghost stories and folklore to escape the endless night.","steam_appid":3879230,"support_info":{"email":"serok1008@geniesoft.io","url":""},"supported_languages":"Korean, English","type":"demo","website":null}